  "description": "A parametric OVEN on the six-node spine — Geometry → Input Properties → Math Engine → Output Metrics → 2D Render + 3D Render.\n\nSEPARATE FROM THE STOVE, because a built-in oven at eye level in a tall housing is not the box under a hob. This one is mounted by \"Height above floor\" and has no hob at all — pair it with the stove's \"Built-in hob\" option and you have the split kitchen most plans actually draw.\n\nDOUBLE IS A SPLIT, not a second object: the door area divides at 42%, giving the small top cavity and the large main one that a double oven really has. Single and Compact are the same construction with one door.\n\nDROP-DOWN CLEARANCE is published at 95% of the depth — an oven door falls forward, and the number that matters is how far into the room it swings, not how wide the appliance is.",
